  "id": "30-ack-rules",
  "title": "ACK right after resume is legal; an ACK with another ep is ignored; above what was sent is E_PROTO",
  "spec": "4.2",
  "description": "'Sent' = max(resume position, highest seq sent, S of the last SNAP). The client may ACK its resume position at once (revision 1 would have answered E_PROTO and looped). An ACK carrying an older ep (delayed across a SNAP(epoch)) is ignored; one below the last ACK is ignored; one above 'sent' is a protocol error.",
